 "body": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\" class=\"no-js\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n    <meta http-equiv=\"X-UA-Compatible\" content=\"IE=edge\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1, maximum-scale=1, user-scalable=no\">\n    <!-- 匿名页面令牌已移除（公开归档不保留） -->\n    <meta name=\"renderer\" content=\"webkit\">\n    <script>\n        window.__feInitLocalTime = new Date().getTime() / 1000;\n        window.__feConfigVersion = '74d532c6c7861bfe'; window.__feConfigRequest = '\\/_lfe\\/config'; window.__fePhoneHomeCall = 'https\\u003A\\/\\/moshimoshi\\u003Aagltb3noatpwohhuenb5ag1tc2jsnnl3\\u0040errtrack.luogu.com.cn\\/lotlp1';        window.__luoguTagVersion = 'zh\\u002DCN\\/2026112601'; window.__luoguTagRequest = '\\/_lfe\\/tags';\n    </script>\n    <title>题解 P1179 【数字统计】 - 洛谷专栏</title>\n    <link rel=\"icon\" href=\"https://fecdn.luogu.com.cn/favicon.ico\">\n    <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Security-Policy\" content=\"default-src 'unsafe-eval' 'unsafe-inline' luogu.com *.luogu.com luogu.com.cn *.luogu.com.cn luogu.org *.luogu.org wss: blob: luoguprivate.oss-cn-hangzhou.aliyuncs.com luogu.oss-cn-hangzhou.aliyuncs.com https://challenges.cloudflare.com https://*.dun.163yun.com https://*.dun.163.com https://*.nosdn.126.net https://*.nosdn.127.net https://nos.netease.com https://cstaticdun.126.net https://cstaticdun1.126.net https://cstaticdun-v6.126.net https://acstatic-dun.126.net; img-src * data:; font-src * data:; worker-src data: blob:; frame-src https://fecdn.luogu.com.cn https://player.bilibili.com https://www.bilibili.com https://challenges.cloudflare.com\">\n        <script id=\"lentille-context\" type=\"application/json\">{\"instance\":\"main\",\"template\":\"article.show\",\"status\":200,\"locale\":\"zh-CN\",\"data\":{\"article\":{\"lid\":\"59x93a43\",\"title\":\"\\u9898\\u89e3 P1179 \\u3010\\u6570\\u5b57\\u7edf\\u8ba1\\u3011\",\"category\":2,\"time\":1509148543,\"author\":{\"uid\":42229,\"avatar\":\"https:\\/\\/cdn.luogu.com.cn\\/upload\\/usericon\\/42229.png\",\"name\":\"gcrx\",\"slogan\":\"\",\"badge\":null,\"isAdmin\":false,\"isBanned\":false,\"color\":\"Blue\",\"ccfLevel\":0,\"xcpcLevel\":0,\"background\":\"\"},\"upvote\":277,\"replyCount\":104,\"favorCount\":1,\"status\":2,\"solutionFor\":{\"pid\":\"P1179\",\"type\":\"P\",\"name\":\"[NOIP 2010 \\u666e\\u53ca\\u7ec4] \\u6570\\u5b57\\u7edf\\u8ba1\",\"difficulty\":1,\"fullScore\":100},\"promoteStatus\":0,\"collection\":null,\"content\":\"##\\u8fd9\\u9053\\u9898\\u91cd\\u70b9\\u5728\\u4e8e**\\u5206\\u79bb\\u591a\\u4f4d\\u6570**\\uff0c\\u53ea\\u8981\\u5c06\\u5206\\u79bb\\u591a\\u4f4d\\u6570\\u638c\\u63e1\\u597d\\uff0c\\u8fd9\\u9053\\u9898\\u5c31\\u975e\\u5e38\\u7684\\u7b80\\u5355\\u4e86\\u3002\\n\\n###\\u672c\\u9898\\u7684\\u5206\\u79bb\\u591a\\u4f4d\\u6570\\u7a0b\\u5e8f\\u6bb5\\uff1a\\n\\n```cpp\\nwhile(x!=0)\\n{\\nif(x%10==2) s++;\\nx\\/=10;\\n}\\n```\\n#\\u8fd9\\u6837\\u5c31\\u5f88\\u7b80\\u5355\\u4e86\\u3002\\n#\\u6309\\u7167\\u4e0a\\u9762\\u7684\\u7684\\u601d\\u8def\\uff0c\\u6211\\u7f16\\u7684\\u7a0b\\u5e8f\\u662f\\u2014\\u2014\\n\\n```cpp\\n#include\\u003Ciostream\\u003E\\nusing namespace std;\\nint main()\\n{\\n    long long a,b,s=0;\\/\\/s\\u8981\\u8d4b\\u521d\\u503c\\uff0c\\u4e0d\\u7136\\u8fd0\\u884c\\u540e\\u6709\\u4e00\\u5927\\u5806\\u6570\\u5b57\\n    cin\\u003E\\u003Ea\\u003E\\u003Eb;\\n    for(int y=a;y\\u003C=b;y++)\\n    {\\n        while(y!=0)\\n        {\\n            if(y%10==2) s++;\\/\\/\\u5206\\u79bb\\u591a\\u4f4d\\u6570\\uff0c\\u5224\\u65ad\\u662f\\u5426\\u7b49\\u4e8e\\u4e8c\\n            y\\/=10;\\n        }\\n    }\\n    cout\\u003C\\u003Cs;\\n        return 0;\\n}\\n```\\n###**\\u5f53\\u6211\\u4fe1\\u5fc3\\u6ee1\\u6ee1\\u7684\\u628a\\u8fd9\\u4e2a\\u4ee3\\u7801\\u63d0\\u4ea4\\u6d1b\\u8c37\\u540e\\uff0c\\u6d1b\\u8c37\\u663e\\u793a\\u2014\\u2014\\u5168\\u90e8\\u8d85\\u65f6\\uff01\\uff01**\\n#What\\u0027s wrong?\\n\\n###\\u6211\\u518d\\u91cd\\u65b0\\u5206\\u6790\\u4ee3\\u7801\\uff0c\\u53d1\\u73b0\\u4e86\\u4e00\\u4e2a\\u9519\\u8bef\\u2014\\u2014\\u6211\\u6539\\u53d8\\u4e86\\u5faa\\u73af\\u53d8\\u91cf\\u7684\\u503c\\u3002\\n\\n###\\u6240\\u4ee5\\uff0cAC\\u4ee3\\u7801\\u5e94\\u8be5\\u662f\\u8fd9\\u6837\\u7684\\uff1a\\n\\n```cpp\\n#include\\u003Ciostream\\u003E\\nusing namespace std;\\nint main()\\n{\\n    long long a,b,s=0,n;\\n    cin\\u003E\\u003Ea\\u003E\\u003Eb;\\n    for(int y=a;y\\u003C=b;y++)\\n    {\\n        n=y;\\/\\/\\u4e0d\\u80fd\\u6539\\u53d8\\u5faa\\u73af\\u53d8\\u91cf\\u7684\\u539f\\u503c\\uff0c\\u6240\\u4ee5\\u8981\\u627e\\u201c\\u66ff\\u8eab\\u201d\\n        while(n!=0)\\n        {\\n            if(n%10==2) s++;\\n            n\\/=10;\\n        }\\n    }\\n    cout\\u003C\\u003Cs;\\n        return 0;\\n}\\n\\u4e5f\\u53ef\\u4ee5\\u7528while\\u5faa\\u73af\\u5d4c\\u5957\\u5206\\u79bb\\u591a\\u4f4d\\u6570\\uff0c\\u8fd9\\u91cc\\u5c31\\u4e0d\\u518d\\u8be6\\u7ec6\\u9610\\u8ff0\\u4e86\\uff0c\\u5c31\\u7559\\u7ed9\\u5927\\u5bb6\\u601d\\u8003\\u5427\\uff01\\n```\",\"categoryOld\":\"\\u9898\\u89e3\",\"contentFull\":true,\"adminNote\":null},\"favored\":false,\"voted\":null,\"canReply\":false,\"canEdit\":false},\"user\":null,\"time\":1795629538.006441}</script>            <script src=\"https://fecdn.luogu.com.cn/columba/loader.20261113-2335.js\" charset=\"utf-8\" defer></script>\n    <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://fecdn.luogu.com.cn/columba/loader.20261113-2335.css\" />\n    <script src=\"https://fecdn.luogu.com.cn/columba/vendor.20261113-2335.js\" charset=\"utf-8\" defer></script>\n        <link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://www.luogu.com/article/59x93a43\" />\n    <script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https:\\/\\/schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Article\",\"name\":\"\\u9898\\u89e3 P1179 \\u3010\\u6570\\u5b57\\u7edf\\u8ba1\\u3011\",\"description\":\"\\u8fd9\\u9053\\u9898\\u91cd\\u70b9\\u5728\\u4e8e\\u5206\\u79bb\\u591a\\u4f4d\\u6570\\uff0c\\u53ea\\u8981\\u5c06\\u5206\\u79bb\\u591a\\u4f4d\\u6570\\u638c\\u63e1\\u597d\\uff0c\\u8fd9\\u9053\\u9898\\u5c31\\u975e\\u5e38\\u7684\\u7b80\\u5355\\u4e86\\u3002\\n\\u672c\\u9898\\u7684\\u5206\\u79bb\\u591a\\u4f4d\\u6570\\u7a0b\\u5e8f\\u6bb5\\uff1a\\nwhile(x!=0)\\n{\\nif(x%10==2) s++;\\nx\\/=10;\\n}\\n\\u8fd9\\u6837\\u5c31\\u5f88\\u7b80\\u5355\\u4e86\\u3002\\n\\u6309\\u7167\\u4e0a\\u9762\\u7684\\u7684\\u601d\\u8def\\uff0c\\u6211\\u7f16\\u7684\\u7a0b\\u5e8f\\u662f\\u2014\\u2014\\n#include&lt;iostream&gt;\\u2026\",\"genre\":\"\\u9898\\u89e3\",\"author\":{\"@type\":\"Person\",\"name\":\"gcrx\"},\"datePublished\":\"2017-10-28T07:55:43+08:00\"}</script>\n    <meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"article\" />\n    <meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"题解 P1179 【数字统计】\" />\n    <meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"这道题重点在于分离多位数，只要将分离多位数掌握好，这道题就非常的简单了。\n本题的分离多位数程序段：\nwhile(x!=0)\n{\nif(x%10==2) s++;\nx/=10;\n}\n这样就很简单了。\n按照上面的的思路，我编的程序是——\n#include&amp;lt;iostream&amp;gt;…\" />\n    <meta property=\"article:section\" content=\"题解\" />\n    <meta property=\"article:author\" content=\"gcrx\" />\n    <meta property=\"article:published_time\" content=\"2017-10-28T07:55:43+08:00\" />\n    <meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://www.luogu.com/article/59x93a43\" />\n    <meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"洛谷专栏\" />\n        <script id=\"luogu-theme\" type=\"application/json\">{\"id\":1,\"lNavi\":{\"back\":\"#ffffff\",\"fore\":\"#262626\",\"logo\":null},\"lBody\":{\"back\":\"#f0f4fa\",\"blur\":1000,\"fade\":1000,\"image\":\"https:\\/\\/cdn.luogu.com.cn\\/images\\/bg\\/fe\\/luogu4-bg-l.jpg\",\"midOpts\":{\"size\":\"cover\"}},\"dNavi\":{\"back\":\"#1d2025\",\"fore\":\"#ffffff\",\"logo\":\"#ffffff\"},\"dBody\":{\"back\":\"#0d1018\",\"blur\":1000,\"fade\":1000,\"image\":\"https:\\/\\/cdn.luogu.com.cn\\/images\\/bg\\/fe\\/luogu4-bg-d.jpg\",\"midOpts\":{\"size\":\"cover\"}}}</script>\n    <style></style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div id=\"app\">\n    <noscript>\n        <h3>请<b style=\"color:#f00;\">不要禁用</b>脚本，否则网页无法正常加载</h3>\n    </noscript>\n        <article>\n        <h1>题解 P1179 【数字统计】</h1>\n        <p style=\"font-size: .75em;\">\n            <a rel=\"author\">gcrx</a>\n            ·\n            <time datetime=\"2017-10-28T07:55:43+08:00\">2017-10-28 07:55:43</time>\n            ·\n            <a href=\"/article?category=2\">题解</a>\n        </p>\n\n        <h2>这道题重点在于<strong>分离多位数</strong>，只要将分离多位数掌握好，这道题就非常的简单了。</h2>\n<h3>本题的分离多位数程序段：</h3>\n<pre><code class=\"language-cpp\">while(x!=0)\n{\nif(x%10==2) s++;\nx/=10;\n}</code></pre>\n<h1>这样就很简单了。</h1>\n<h1>按照上面的的思路，我编的程序是——</h1>\n<pre><code class=\"language-cpp\">#include&lt;iostream&gt;\nusing namespace std;\nint main()\n{\n    long long a,b,s=0;//s要赋初值，不然运行后有一大堆数字\n    cin&gt;&gt;a&gt;&gt;b;\n    for(int y=a;y&lt;=b;y++)\n    {\n        while(y!=0)\n        {\n            if(y%10==2) s++;//分离多位数，判断是否等于二\n            y/=10;\n        }\n    }\n    cout&lt;&lt;s;\n        return 0;\n}</code></pre>\n<h3><strong>当我信心满满的把这个代码提交洛谷后，洛谷显示——全部超时！！</strong></h3>\n<h1>What's wrong?</h1>\n<h3>我再重新分析代码，发现了一个错误——我改变了循环变量的值。</h3>\n<h3>所以，AC代码应该是这样的：</h3>\n<pre><code class=\"language-cpp\">#include&lt;iostream&gt;\nusing namespace std;\nint main()\n{\n    long long a,b,s=0,n;\n    cin&gt;&gt;a&gt;&gt;b;\n    for(int y=a;y&lt;=b;y++)\n    {\n        n=y;//不能改变循环变量的原值，所以要找“替身”\n        while(n!=0)\n        {\n            if(n%10==2) s++;\n            n/=10;\n        }\n    }\n    cout&lt;&lt;s;\n        return 0;\n}\n也可以用while循环嵌套分离多位数，这里就不再详细阐述了，就留给大家思考吧！</code></pre>\n    </article>\n</div>\n<script>(function(){function c(){var b=a.contentDocument||(a.contentWindow&&a.contentWindow.document);if(b){var d=b.createElement('script');d.innerHTML=\"window.__CF$cv$params={r:'a6028b611abaface',t:'MTc5NTYyOTUzNw=='};var l=window.parent.location,o;try{o=new URL(l.origin).origin}catch(e){try{o=new URL(new URL(l.href).origin).origin}catch(e){o=''}}var u='/cdn-cgi/challenge-platform/scripts/jsd/main.js?ray=a6028b611abaface',a=document.createElement('script');a.src=o?new URL(u,o).href:u;document.getElementsByTagName('head')[0].appendChild(a);\";b.getElementsByTagName('head')[0].appendChild(d)}}if(document.body){var a=document.createElement('iframe');a.height=1;a.width=1;a.style.position='absolute';a.style.top=0;a.style.left=0;a.style.border='none';a.style.visibility='hidden';document.body.appendChild(a);if('loading'!==document.readyState)c();else if(window.addEventListener)document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded',c);else{var e=document.onreadystatechange||function(){};document.onreadystatechange=function(b){e(b);'loading'!==document.readyState&&(document.onreadystatechange=e,c())}}}})();</script></body>\n</html>\n",
